 "remarks": "Warm and welcoming from the moment you enter - this light and bright new condominium offering will make you feel at home. Vaulted ceilings, gleaming hardwood floors throughout the main level and numerous updates elevate this gem of an opportunity. The private entry patio includes a thoughtfully curated Zen garden, with plenty of space for outdoor entertaining and easy flow from both the living room and kitchen. A most desirable floor plan with main level primary suite and fully renovated bath with step in shower. Generous rooms throughout, including the living room with fireplace and brick accent wall, a dedicated formal dining room that opens to a second outdoor patio plus a powder room for guests. The spacious kitchen includes newer stainless appliances, granite counters as well as an informal dining area. The first floor also boasts the laundry room and mudroom plus interior access to the attached two car garage. Everything you need on one level plus a fully finished upper level including an open loft/office/studio space, a massive additional bedroom for family or guests and the second full bath. Superior cul-de-sac location in this highly desirable, well managed community. Harvest Commons offers country club amenities including a pool, pool house and two Har-Tru tennis courts. Enjoy worry free living and easy access to shopping and dining, the beaches, highways and the railroad in a most convenient Westport location.",
